      "statement": "`OllamaProvider` sends raw text to `ollama run <model>`, creates the output parent, enforces a 900-second processing timeout, removes ANSI output and a recognized leading thinking trace before writing Markdown, and returns unsuccessful results for timeout, process failure, or a missing executable.",
