      "id": "claim_b607ea34a4a54685af52de976f9e1ba4",
      "statement": "Routing prepends generated frontmatter to each scanned transcript, dispatches each configured extraction by append or individual-file mode, and does not make repeated runs idempotent: main transcripts are overwritten with their prior text as content, append targets have no deduplication, and file targets can overwrite same-date slug collisions.",
