      "id": "claim_26dce655e94f4095ae9d4cfd0a0a0d98",
      "statement": "Project classification uses ordered, case-insensitive substring rules where the first matching project wins and no match is `misc`; normal sorting moves the transcript into `projects/<project>/`, while the library also exposes copy mode.",
